    {
      "id": "D6KUFMZ59YTzwh3ego75q",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 999,
      "y": 1510,
      "width": 402.0995788574219,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aE",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2051150143,
      "version": 230,
      "versionNonce": 177762737,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1762086013921,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "belongs to the system\nexists as physical / electronic component\nallocate / deallocate\nsize is predefined\naccessed via address\nnot used directly",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "belongs to the system\nexists as physical / electronic component\nallocate / deallocate\nsize is predefined\naccessed via address\nnot used directly",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "WNkcY4dTbkmeaqjSQaEM0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 387,
      "y": 1504,
      "width": 455.7195739746094,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aF",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1026196561,
      "version": 315,
      "versionNonce": 2132997297,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1762086008164,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "belongs to the each process (VAS per process)\nis a promise, doesn't actually exist\nreserve / unreserve\nVAS size can be varied (there is a cap)\naccessed via address\nused by actual programs",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "belongs to the each process (VAS per process)\nis a promise, doesn't actually exist\nreserve / unreserve\nVAS size can be varied (there is a cap)\naccessed via address\nused by actual programs",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "cPeP7u8-ZDhbd_occ571N",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 690,
      "y": 1740,
      "width": 191.47984313964844,
      "height": 25,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aG",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1821954591,
      "version": 41,
      "versionNonce": 1411003505,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1762086049595,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "why virtual memory?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "why virtual memory?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "MWCyL-YlXEKfQwmhP_e-D",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 599,
      "y": 1798,
      "width": 975.419189453125,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aH",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1843940191,
      "version": 492,
      "versionNonce": 163971263,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1762086171175,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "each process thinks it has full access to memory - it has its own VAS\nfor each process, addressing starts at 0\ngives the impression to have more (virtual) memory than the actual available system physical memory\ncan share virtual memory with other processes\neach process is isolated in its own virtual address space - isolation, security",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
